29" end="00:53.530">国</span><span begin="00:53.530" end="00:53.830">無</span><span begin="00:53.830" end="00:54.365">双</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">少年少女战国无双</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">syounen syoujyo sengoku musou</span></p><p begin="00:54.304" end="00:56.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:54.304" end="00:54.493">浮</span><span begin="00:54.493" end="00:54.837">世</span><span begin="00:54.837" end="00:55.437">の</span><span begin="00:55.437" end="00:56.143">随</span><span begin="00:56.143" end="00:56.971">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随波逐流漂在那浮世浪潮之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ukiyo no manimani</span></p><p begin="00:57.415" end="01:00.311" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:57.415" end="00:57.769">千</span><span begin="00:57.769" end="00:58.076">本</span><span begin="00:58.076" end="00:58.982">桜</span><span begin="00:59.153" end="00:59.465">夜</span><span begin="00:59.465" end="00:59.714">ニ</span><span begin="00:59.714" end="01:00.047">紛</span><span begin="01:00.047" end="01:00.311">レ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN"> 千本樱融入夜中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">senbon zakura     yoru ni magire</span></p><p begin="01:00.574" end="01:03.406" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:00.574" end="01:00.950">君</span><span begin="01:00.950" end="01:01.289">ノ</span><span begin="01:01.289" end="01:01.594">声</span><span begin="01:01.594" end="01:02.017">モ</span><span begin="01:02.254" end="01:02.609">届</span><span begin="01:02.609" end="01:02.830">カ</span><span begin="01:02.830" end="01:03.010">ナ</span><span begin="01:03.010" end="01:03.164">イ</span><span begin="01:03.164" end="01:03.406">ヨ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连你的声音也无法传达啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">  kimi no koe mo todokana i yo</span></p><p begin="01:03.668" end="01:06.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:03.668" end="01:03.840">此</span><span begin="01:03.840" end="01:04.032">処</span><span begin="01:04.032" end="01:04.269">は</span><span begin="01:04.269" end="01:05.231">宴</span><span begin="01:05.357" end="01:05.917">鋼</span><span begin="01:05.917" end="01:06.219">の</span><span begin="01:06.219" end="01:06.505">檻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN"> 此处开宴钢铁牢笼中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokowa utage hagane no ori</span></p><p begin="01:06.698" end="01:09.596" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:06.698" end="01:06.855">そ</span><span begin="01:06.855" end="01:07.090">の</span><span begin="01:07.090" end="01:07.422">断</span><span begin="01:07.422" end="01:07.793">頭</span><span begin="01:07.793" end="01:08.185">台</span><span begin="01:08.185" end="01:08.626">で</span><span begin="01:08.626" end="01:08.871">見</span><span begin="01:08.871" end="01:09.050">下</span><span begin="01:09.050" end="01:09.207">ろ</span><span begin="01:09.207" end="01:09.389">し</span><span begin="01:09.389" end="01:09.596">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那断头台下俯视众生吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no dantou dai de mioroshi te</span></p><p begin="01:09.888" end="01:12.675" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:09.888" end="01:10.176">三</span><span begin="01:10.176" end="01:10.491">千</span><span begin="01:10.491" end="01:10.794">世</span><span begin="01:10.794" end="01:11.379">界</span><span begin="01:11.613" end="01:11.829">常</span><span begin="01:11.829" end="01:12.165">世</span><span begin="01:12.165" end="01:12.381">之</span><span begin="01:12.381" end="01:12.675">闇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">三千世界黄泉之暗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sanzen sekaii tokoyo no yami </span></p><p begin="01:12.980" end="01:15.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:12.980" end="01:13.316">嘆</span><span begin="01:13.316" end="01:13.562">ク</span><span begin="01:13.562" end="01:14.048">唄</span><span begin="01:14.048" end="01:14.486">モ</span><span begin="01:14.711" end="01:14.936">聞</span