begin="01:36.786" end="01:37.074">見</span><span begin="01:37.074" end="01:37.284">た</span><span begin="01:37.284" end="01:37.524">目</span><span begin="01:37.524" end="01:37.713">は</span><span begin="01:37.713" end="01:37.899">将</span><span begin="01:37.899" end="01:38.196">校</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看来身经百战实为将校</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hyakusen renma no mitame wa syoukou</span></p><p begin="01:38.293" end="01:41.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:38.293" end="01:38.554">い</span><span begin="01:38.554" end="01:38.761">っ</span><span begin="01:38.761" end="01:38.935">た</span><span begin="01:38.935" end="01:39.091">り</span><span begin="01:39.091" end="01:39.301">き</span><span begin="01:39.301" end="01:39.466">た</span><span begin="01:39.466" end="01:39.628">り</span><span begin="01:39.628" end="01:39.847">の</span><span begin="01:39.847" end="01:40.243">花</span><span begin="01:40.243" end="01:40.579">魁</span><span begin="01:40.579" end="01:40.936">道</span><span begin="01:40.936" end="01:41.140">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">人潮来往的花魁道中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itta ri ki ta ri no oiran dou cyuu</span></p><p begin="01:41.413" end="01:44.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:41.413" end="01:41.602">ア</span><span begin="01:41.602" end="01:41.794">イ</span><span begin="01:41.794" end="01:41.955">ツ</span><span begin="01:41.955" end="01:42.226">も</span><span begin="01:42.226" end="01:42.426">コ</span><span begin="01:42.426" end="01:42.589">イ</span><span begin="01:42.589" end="01:42.699">ツ</span><span begin="01:42.699" end="01:42.978">も</span><span begin="01:42.978" end="01:43.587">皆</span><span begin="01:43.587" end="01:43.777">で</span><span begin="01:43.777" end="01:44.082">集</span><span begin="01:44.082" end="01:44.293">ま</span><span begin="01:44.293" end="01:44.418">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不管是谁都过来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a i tsu mo ko i tsu mo minna de atsumare</span></p><p begin="01:44.550" end="01:46.031" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:44.550" end="01:44.937">聖</span><span begin="01:44.937" end="01:45.168">者</span><span begin="01:45.168" end="01:45.329">の</span><span begin="01:45.329" end="01:45.575">行</span><span begin="01:45.575" end="01:46.031">進</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:46.127" end="01:47.572"><span begin="01:46.127" end="01:46.406">(わ</span><span begin="01:46.406" end="01:46.571">ん</span><span begin="01:46.571" end="01:46.715">っ</span><span begin="01:46.715" end="01:46.844">つ</span><span begin="01:46.844" end="01:46.984">ー</span><span begin="01:46.984" end="01:47.168">さ</span><span begin="01:47.168" end="01:47.374">ん</span><span begin="01:47.374" end="01:47.468">し</span><span begin="01:47.468" end="01:47.572">っ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一二三四</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wan  tsu- san shi</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">圣者的行进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">seijya no koushin   </span></p><p begin="01:47.692" end="01:50.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:47.692" end="01:48.064">禅</span><span begin="01:48.064" end="01:48.433">定</span><span begin="01:48.433" end="01:48.817">門</span><span begin="01:48.817" end="01:49.198">を</span><span begin="01:49.198" end="01:49.498">潜</span><span begin="01:49.498" end="01:49.636">り</span><span begin="01:49.636" end="01:49.897">抜</span><span begin="01:49.897" end="01:50.011">け</span><span begin="01:50.011" end="01:50.371">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">穿过那禅定门户前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zenjyou mon wo kuguri nuke te</span></p><p begin="01:50.824" end="01:53.312" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:50.824" end="01:51.193">安</span><span begin="01:51.193" end="01:51.488">楽</span><span begin="01:51.488" end="01:51.937">浄</span><span begin="01:51.937" end="01:52.334">土</span><span begin="01:52.334" end="01:52.673">厄</span><span begin="01:52.673" end="01:53.042">払</span><span begin="01:53.042" end="01:53.312">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">安乐净土驱凶避邪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anraku jyoudo yaku barai</span></p><p begin="01:53.893" end="01:56.407" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:53.893" end="01:54.137">き</span><span begin="01:54.137" end="01:54.325">っ</span><span begin="01:54.325" end="01:54.643">と</span><span begin="01:54.643" end="01:55.025">終</span><span begin="01:55.025" end="01:55.234">幕</span><span begin="01:55.234" end="01:55.459">は</span><span begin="01:55.459" end="01:55.867">大</span><span begin="01:55.867" end="01:56.189">団</span><span begin="01:56.189" end="01:56.407">円</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">最后一幕必定就是大团圆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kitto saigo wa dai danen</span></p><p begin="01:56.644" end="01:59.422" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:56.644" end="01:56.926">拍</span><span begin="01:56.926" end="01:57.163">手</span><span begin="01:57.163" end="01:57.475">の</span><span begin="01:57.634" end="01:57.850">合</span><span begin="01:57.850" end="01:58.468">間</span><span begin="01:58.468" end="01:59.422">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在掌声响起的的同时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman"> hakusyu no aima ni</span></p><p begin="01:59.804" end="02:02.707" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:59.804" end="02:00.062">千</span><span begin="02:00.062" end="02:00.440">本</span><span begin="02:00.440" end="02:01.310">桜</span><span begin="02:01.553" end="02:01.901">夜</span><span begin="02:01.901" end="02:02.114">ニ</span><span begin="02:02.114" end="02:02.471">紛</span><span begin="02:02.471" end="02:02.707">レ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN"> 千本樱融入夜中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">senbon zakura  yoru ni magire </span></p><p begin="02:02.906" end="02:05.762" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:02.906" end="02:03.271">君</span><span begin="02:03.271" end="02:03.563">ノ</span><span begin="02:03.563" end="02:04.019">声</span><span begin="02:04.019" end="02:04.451">モ</span><span begin="02:04.675" end="02:04.991">届</span><span begin="02:04.991" end="02:05.177">カ</span><span begin="02:05.177" end="02:05.407">ナ</span><span begin="02:05.407" end="02:05.563">イ</span><span begin="02:05.563" end="02:05.762">ヨ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连你的声音也无法传达啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi no koe mo todokana i yo</span></p><p begin="02:06.031" end="02:08.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:06.031" end="02:06.388">此</span><span begin="02:06.388" end="02:06.520">処</span><span begin="02:06.520" end="02:06.758">は</span><span begin="02:06.758" end="02:07.600">宴</span><span begin="02:07.783" end="02:08.318">鋼</span><span begin="02:08.318" end="02:08.666">の</span><span begin="02:08.666" end="02:08.933">檻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN"> 此处开宴钢铁牢笼中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokowa utage hagane no ori </span></p><p begin="02:09.113" end="02:12.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:09.113" end="02:09.335">そ</span><span begin="02:09.335" end="02:09.503">の</span><span begin="02:09.503" end="02:09.857">断</span><span begin="02:09.857" end="02:10.193">頭</span><span begin="02:10.193" end="02:10.577">台</span><span begin="02:10.577" end="02:11.021">で</span><span begin="02:11.021" end="02:11.237">見</span><span begin="02:11.237" end="02:11.414">下</span><span begin="02:11.414" end="02:11.612">ろ</span><span begin="02:11.612" end="02:11.798">し</span><span begin="02:11.798" end="02:12.023">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那断头台下俯视众生吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no dantou dai de mioroshi te</span></p><p begin="02:12.242" end="02:15.107" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:12.242" end="02:12.596">三</span><span begin="02:12.596" end="02:12.914">千</span><span begin="02:12.914" end="02:13.211">世</span><span begin="02:13.211" end="02:13.721">界</span><span begin="02:14.006" end="02:14.222">常</span><span begin="02:14.222" end="02:14.546">世</span><span begin="02:14.546" end="02:14.786">之</span><span begin="02:14.786" end="02:15.107">闇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">三千世界黄泉之暗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sanzen sekaii tokoyo no yami </span></p><p begin="02:15.265" end="02:18.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:15.265" end="02:15.601">嘆</span><span begin="02:15.601" end="02:15.889">ク</span><span begin="02:15.889" end="02:16.381">唄</span><span begin="02:16.381" end="02:16.864">モ</span><span begin="02:17.047" end="02:17.241">聞</span><span begin="02:17.241" end="02:17.448">コ</span><span begin="02:17.448" end="02:17.625">エ</span><span begin="02:17.625" end="02:17.823">ナ</span><span begin="02:17.823" end="02:17.982">イ</span><span begin="02:17.982" end="02:18.207">ヨ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连那哀叹之歌也听也无法听见啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nageku uta mo kikoe na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:18.516" end="02:21.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:18.516" end="02:18.762">希</span><span begin="02:18.762" end="02:18.915">望</span><span begin="02:18.915" end="02:19.194">の</span><span begin="02:19.194" end="02:20.049">丘</span><span begin="02:20.220" end="02:20.595">遥</span><span begin="02:20.595" end="02:20.781">か</span><span begin="02:20.781" end="02:21.111">彼</span><span begin="02:21.111" end="02:21.441">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那希望之丘的遥远彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kibou no oka haruka kanata </span></p><p begin="02:21.605" end="02:25.061" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:21.605" end="02:21.755">そ</span><span begin="02:21.755" end="02:21.929">の</span><span begin="02:21.929" end="02:22.307">閃</span><span begin="02:22.307" end="02:22.673">光</span><span begin="02:22.673" end="02:23.085">弾</span><span begin="02:23.085" end="02:23.453">を</span><span begin="02:23.453" end="02:23.649">打</span><span begin="02:23.649" end="02:23.837">ち</span><span begin="02:23.837" end="02:24.065">上</span><span begin="02:24.065" end="02:24.261">げ</span><span begin="02:24.261" end="02:25.061">ろ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就将那闪光弹射向天际吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no senkou dan wo uchi age ro</span></p><p begin="02:56.238" end="02:58.847" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:56.238" end="02:56.526">環</span><span begin="02:56.526" end="02:56.915">状</span><span begin="02:56.915" end="02:57.212">線</span><span begin="02:57.212" end="02:57.678">を</span><span begin="02:57.678" end="02:57.902">走</span><span begin="02:57.902" end="02:58.086">り</span><span begin="02:58.086" end="02:58.304">抜</span><span begin="02:58.304" end="02:58.482">け</span><span begin="02:58.482" end="02:58.847">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">奔驰穿过环状线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kanjyou sen wo hashiri nuke te </span></p><p begin="02:59.300" end="03:01.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:59.300" end="02:59.582">東</span><span begin="02:59.582" end="02:59.939">奔</span><span begin="02:59.939" end="03:00.374">西</span><span begin="03:00.374" end="03:00.803">走</span><span begin="03:00.803" end="03:01.043">な</span><span begin="03:01.043" end="03:01.232">ん</span><span begin="03:01.232" end="03:01.373">の</span><span begin="03:01.373" end="03:01.550">そ</span><span begin="03:01.550" end="03:01.955">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">东奔西走不算什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">touhonseisou nan no so no</span></p><p begin="03:02.426" end="03:04.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="03:02.426" end="03:02.721">少</span><span begin="03:02.721" end="03:03.086">年</span><span begin="03:03.086" end="03:03.515">少</span><span begin="03:03.515" end="03:03.878">女</span><span begin="03:03.878" end="03:04.098">戦</span><span begin="03:04.098" end="03:04.298">国</span><span begin="03:04.298" end="03:04.665">無</span><span begin="03:04.665" end="03:04.922">双</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">少年少女战国无双</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">syounen syoujyo sengoku musou</span></p><p begin="03:05.154" end="03:07.838" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:05.154" end="03:05.486">浮</span><span begin="03:05.486" end="03:05.726">世</span><span begin="03:05.726" end="03:06.116">の</span><span begin="03:06.116" end="03:07.028">随</span><span begin="03:07.028" end="03:07.838">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随波逐流漂在那浮世浪潮之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ukiyo no manimani</span></p><p begin="03:08.286" end="03:11.169" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:08.286" end="03:08.522">千</span><span begin="03:08.522" end="03:08.922">本</span><span begin="03:08.922" end="03:09.834">桜</span><span begin="03:10.010" end="03:10.224">夜</span><span begin="03:10.224" end="03:10.500">ニ</span><span begin="03:10.500" end="03:10.898">紛</span><span begin="03:10.898" end="03:11.169">レ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">千本樱融入夜中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">senbon zakura yoru ni magire</span></p><p begin="03:11.340" end="03:14.229" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="03:11.340" end="03:11.715">君</span><span begin="03:11.715" end="03:12.030">ノ</span><span begin="03:12.030" end="03:12.450">声</span><span begin="03:12.450" end="03:12.921">モ</span><span begin="03:13.140" end="03:13.350">届</span><span begin="03:13.350" end="03:13.650">カ</span><span begin="03:13.650" end="03:13.845">ナ</span><span begin="03:13.845" end="03:14.001">イ</span><span begin="03:14.001" end="03:14.229">ヨ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连你的声音也无法传达啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi no koe mo todokana i yo</span></p><p begin="03:14.514" end="03:17.367" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="03:14.514" end="03:14.652">此</span><span begin="03:14.652" end="03:14.847">処</span><span begin="03:14.847" end="03:15.126">は</span><span begin="03:15.126" end="03:16.065">宴</span><span begin="03:16.236" end="03:16.755">鋼</span><span begin="03:16.755" end="03:17.110">の</span><span begin="03:17.110" end="03:17.367">檻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN"> 此处开宴钢铁牢笼中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokowa utage hagane no ori</span></p><p begin="03:17.566" end="03:20.562" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="03:17.566" end="03:17.731">そ</span><span begin="03:17.731" end="03:17.959">の</span><span begin="03:17.959" end="03:18.274">断</span><span begin="03:18.274" end="03:18.631">頭</span><span begin="03:18.631" end="03:19.045">台</span><span begin="03:19.045" end="03:19.373">を</span><span begin="03:19.584" end="03:19.830">飛</span><span begin="03:19.830" end="03:20.001">び</span><span begin="03:20.001" end="03:20.229">降</span><span begin="03:20.229" end="03:20.382">り</span><span begin="03:20.382" end="03:20.562">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">从那断头台一跃而下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no dantou dai wo tobi ori te</span></p><p begin="03:20.832" end="03:23.703" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="03:20.832" end="03:21.093">千</span><span begin="03:21.093" end="03:21.363">本</span><span begin="03:21.363" end="03:22.318">桜</span><span begin="03:22.524" end="03:22.821">夜</span><span begin="03:22.821" end="03:23.031">ニ</span><span begin="03:23.031" end="03:23.481">紛</span><span begin="03:23.481" end="03:23.703">レ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">千本樱融入夜中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">senbon zakura yoru ni magire</span></p><p begin="03:23.921" end="03:26.748" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="03:23.921" end="03:24.233">君</span><span begin="03:24.233" end="03:24.617">が</span><span begin="03:24.617" end="03:24.989">歌</span><span begin="03:24.989" end="03:25.365">い</span><span begin="03:25.661" end="03:25.992">僕</span><span begin="03:25.992" end="03:26.177">は</span><span begin="03:26.177" end="03:26.544">踊</span><span begin="03:26.544" end="03:26.748">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你唱着歌啊 我跳着舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi ga utai boku wa odoru</span></p><p begin="03:27.039" end="03:29.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="03:27.039" end="03:27.189">此</span><span begin="03:27.189" end="03:27.393">処</span><span begin="03:27.393" end="03:27.681">は</span><span begin="03:27.681" end="03:28.485">宴</span><span begin="03:28.794" end="03:29.250">鋼</span><span begin="03:29.250" end="03:29.636">の</span><span begin="03:29.636" end="03:29.941">檻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此处开宴钢铁牢笼中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokowa utage hagane no ori  </span></p><p begin="03:30.165" end="03:35.589" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="03:30.165" end="03:30.301">さ</span><span begin="03:30.301" end="03:30.486">あ</span><span begin="03:30.486" end="03:30.861">光</span><span begin="03:30.861" end="03:31.192">線</span><span begin="03:31.192" end="03:31.566">銃</span><span begin="03:31.566" end="03:32.077">を</span><span begin="03:32.077" end="03:32.262">撃</span><span begin="03:32.262" end="03:32.428">ち</span><span begin="03:32.428" end="03:32.617">ま</span><span begin="03:32.617" end="03:32.793">く</span><span begin="03:32.793" end="03:35.589">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来扣下光线枪的板机尽情扫射吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman"> sa a kousen jyuu wo uchi ma ku re</span></p></div></body></tt>